      "text": "1.) Web Crawls, buffering retrieved\ncontent, capturing next links 2.) Jev-\nas-low-confidence judge flags\nwhether this page has information\nworth looking at, whether next links\nshould be queued 3.) queues next\nlinks, if applicable 4.) pulls next link\nand continues",
