      "text": "--classifier-concurrency is per-process, so\nit multiplies by N: enforce via rate_tokens\nrow in Postgres. Heartbeat row every 30s.\nCredential scrubbing stays in-process.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
