      "originalText": "Removed from this box: Doctor process. Judge kept here as its own service.\nHorizontal scale = clone this VM from the same OpenTofu module + cloud-init.\nPostgres queue + per-host leases coordinate; no orchestrator needed.",
      "autoResize": true,
